

 Minutes of FIGGY BAR RT Conference.

Date: 06/13/91   Time: 22:27EDT
    
   Items discussed include some interesting riddles, search for an ANS
   Forth referee for 'Forth Dimensions', Intel 80196, and the Sergei
   Baranoff conference on 20 June which lead to an exchange on Soviet
   history.

